# NOTICE

Harvy's Tower intelligence surface takes abstract layout inspiration from
World Monitor (github.com/koala73/worldmonitor, licensed AGPL-3.0-only): a
world map, a ranked regional intensity list, and a stream freshness strip.
No World Monitor source code, CSS, or assets were copied, ported, adapted, or
transcribed. The surface is built from scratch with Harvy's own MUI
components and theme tokens.
